  ('1109 Series goRAIL® (43mm Length)', '1109-0024-0043', 'The 43mm length goRAIL is an excellent option for adding structural integrity to 1120 Series U-Channel. It is able to span the 43mm inside width of the 1120 Series U-Channel and align with any 14mm hole in the channel so you can run bearings and shafting through. This 43mm Length goRAIL® is a length of T-slot extrusion: a structural component that allows for slide-and-fasten style building using the T-slots down its sides. Hurricane Nuts and 5-Hole goRAIL® Nuts are perfect for utilizing the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1109-series-gorail-43mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/201/images/1347/1109-0024-0043Ang1Patented__59897__80382.1701991248.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / 1109 Series goRAIL®', 'gobilda'),
  ('1109 Series goRAIL® (48mm Length)', '1109-0024-0048', 'The 48mm length goRAIL matches the width of 1120 Series U-Channel and many other pattern based structural components. It can be used as a spacer between plates, as a bearing carrier, or just to create slide-and-lock mounting options on your pattern based build. This 48mm Length goRAIL® is a length of T-slot extrusion: a structural component that allows for slide-and-fasten style building using the T-slots down its sides. Hurricane Nuts and 5-Hole goRAIL® Nuts are perfect for utilizing the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1109-series-gorail-48mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/192/images/1204/1109-0024-0048Ang1Patented__71233__11739.1701991205.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / 1109 Series goRAIL®', 'gobilda'),
  ('1109 Series goRAIL® (72mm Length)', '1109-0024-0072', 'This 72mm Length goRAIL® is a length of T-slot extrusion: a structural component that allows for slide-and-fasten style building using the T-slots down its sides. Hurricane Nuts and 5-Hole goRAIL® Nuts are perfect for utilizing the T-slots to create countless attachment possibilities using M4 screws. And at both ends of a length of goRAIL®, threaded holes of the goBILDA® 16mm square pattern allow for easy attachment to different structure—such as U-Channel and brackets, as well as other…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1109-series-gorail-72mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/194/images/1239/1109-0024-0072Ang1Patented__98352__78756.1701991216.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / 1109 Series goRAIL®', 'gobilda'),
