  ('1114 Series Flat Bracket (1-1) - 2 Pack', '1114-0001-0001', 'This simple bracket is very versatile. It can be used to attach threaded components to the side of goRAIL®. The screw heads will fit down inside of the slot of the goRAIL® allowing the bracket to lay flat on the side of the goRAIL® and fasten with goRAIL® nuts.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1114-series-flat-bracket-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/212/images/1555/1114-0001-0001__53245__68814.1701991317.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
