  ('Clear Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 5 x 44 Hole, 40 x 352mm)', '1117-0040-0352', 'It''s clear we''re hyped about building on-grid, and we mean that literally: this Clear Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are clearly great for ''bot-building, whether they''re helping to guide an object into your intake mechanism or cladding to your ''bot to cover its vitals. To that end, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both toughness and flexibility. It is able to handle the rigors of a…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/clear-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-5-x-44-hole-40-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2419/images/15212/ThumbScaled__13186__32338.1758298551.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Clear Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 11 x 44 Hole, 88 x 352mm)', '1117-0088-0352', 'It''s clear we''re passionate about building on-grid, and we mean that literally: this Clear Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are transparently important to robot-building, whether they''re helping to guide an element into your collection mechanism or armoring your ''bot to cover its vitals. On that point, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both toughness and flexibility. It is able to…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/clear-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-11-x-44-hole-88-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2420/images/15222/ThumbScaled__44487__88990.1758298566.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Clear Polycarbonate Grid Plate (1.5mm Thickness, 27 x 44 Hole, 216 x 352mm)', '1117-0216-0352', 'It''s clear we''re passionate about building on-grid, and we mean that literally: this Clear Grid Plate brings unique polycarbonate possibilities to the goBILDA® menu of structure! Plates and panels are transparently essential to robot-building, whether they''re helping to route an element into your collection mechanism or cladding to your ''bot to cover its vitals. To that end, the polycarbonate material of this Grid Plate dances a fine line across both toughness and flexibility. It is able to…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/clear-polycarbonate-grid-plate-1-5mm-thickness-27-x-44-hole-216-x-352mm/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2367/images/14478/1117-0216-0352_Ang1__10169__74203.1740156119.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Grid Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1118 Series Open goRAIL® (43mm Length)', '1118-0024-0043', 'The 43mm length Open goRAIL can be used to add structural support to the inside of 1120 Series U-Channel. Tying the two sides of the channel together increases the rigidity for heavy-duty applications and ensures the two sides are perfectly parallel with one(27) another.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1118-series-open-gorail-43mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/228/images/1661/1118-0024-0043Patented__42274__12785.1701991349.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / 1118 Series Open goRAIL®', 'gobilda'),
  ('1118 Series Open goRAIL® (48mm Length)', '1118-0024-0048', 'This Open goRAIL is 48mm long, matching the width of 1120 and 1121 Series channel. You can use this to tie structure together while remaining on pattern or you can even use it as a wire loom.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1118-series-open-gorail-48mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/230/images/1675/1118-0024-0048Patented__18511__94378.1701991353.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / goRAIL® / 1118 Series Open goRAIL®', 'gobilda'),
